Z||000002||Xtreme Fiero's||09-30-2000||09:25 AM||||Have you ever jacked up your car and seen that your wheels didn't look stragit or out of alighment? I belive that is what "Bump-steer" is when the. the wheel travles and the toe in/out changes and steers the car. Is't the best i can explain it||||reg||10
